---
description: Prevent accidental upstream PR creation
alwaysApply: true
---

# PR Remote Safety

- Never create pull requests against upstream repositories.
- Always create pull requests only from this fork branch to this fork's base branch.
- Before `gh pr create`, verify the target explicitly:
  - confirm `--base` branch
  - confirm PR destination repository is not upstream
- If upstream is the only detected destination, stop and ask the user before proceeding.
